"url=\"https://github.com/steveire/grantlee\">Grantlee</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"&i18n-कप्लिकेशन; &kaddressbook; <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/steveire/grantlee\">अनुदानं</ulink> इत्यस्य आधारेण "
"विषयाः ।"

#: index.docbook:59
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &i18n-kapplication;"
msgstr "&i18n-kapplication इत्यस्य उपयोगेन;"

#: index.docbook:60
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This editor is used to create themes for your contacts in &kaddressbook;. "
"More Information you find in the <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.grantlee.org/apidox/\">Grantlee</ulink> documentation."
msgstr ""
"एतत् सम्पादकं &kaddressbook; इत्यत्र भवतः सम्पर्कस्य विषयवस्तुनिर्माणार्थं "
"उपयुज्यते । अधिकानि सूचनानि भवन्तः <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.grantlee.org/apidox/\">Grantlee</ulink> दस्तावेजे "
"प्राप्नुवन्ति ।"

